 ### Claude Code sessions
 
+New sessions start on this harness: **+** (⌘N) opens the New screen (a greeting with your Mac
+account's name, a composer with Chat only / Folder, model, effort, mode and Tools, and your recent
+folders), and the session is created when you send. Set `[sessions].default_harness = "builtin"` to
+start them on the built-in loop instead; scheduled tasks, campaigns, fleet and subagents always use
+the built-in loop, and existing sessions keep their harness. Workflows are hidden in Claude
+subscription sessions (they need the built-in loop with an API key).
+
